{"id":2224,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为践行社会主义核心价值观，传承“敬老、爱老、助老”传统美德，发挥党员先锋模范作用。4月19日，工程力学学生党支部组织部分党员前往太原西山颐养中心，开展“情暖养老院 初心践使命”志愿服务活动，用实际行动为老人们送去关怀与温暖。</p><p>活动中，党员志愿者手把手指导老人们绘画，从简单花草到生活场景，老人们兴致高涨、神情专注；绘画间隙，志愿者与老人们促膝长谈，询问身体状况、倾听心声，用陪伴缓解老人孤独；随后，志愿者唱响红歌，经典旋律回荡院中，老人们轻声跟唱，现场氛围温馨热烈。</p><p>此次养老院志愿服务活动，既让党员在实践中锤炼党性、践行初心，也传承了敬老爱老美德，带动更多人参与志愿服务，用爱心传递温暖、用行动诠释担当，让传统美德在新时代焕发新光彩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nm-WsUmQfo7-ioH7MfM7UPLzVRLl-gPUmL4nzCbM4Cinll0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybM1yYn1hkUlLaL4UZL8lYLmMVU4QfL4liL7MVnlQVnlrFLzG8L7-sLNrFMmQRU4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLmvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9727&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3962FBAC03483E223EC6A3550CEEFEEE/1040B72E/66CC9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nm-WsUmQfo7-ioH7MfM7UPLzVRLl-gPUmL4nzCbM4Cinll0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybM1yYn1hkUlLaL4UZL8lYLmMVU4QfL4liL7MVnlQVnlrFLzG8L7-sLNrFMmQRU4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLmvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9727&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-L8-WbMRLYol-PLHm-bnN-ZL8UPM4Vg2o7UPM4vZUlCDLzG0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRoSyiM1yDLmQRLmLsL4MRnmA2UzfRnznVnNL4nR7ZnRQFnzN8L7UPL7WFMmCZU47Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLmvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9727&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5C956626C23733CF8FA0CE4EFC3D18D6/E940D10B/668C1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-L8-WbMRLYol-PLHm-bnN-ZL8UPM4Vg2o7UPM4vZUlCDLzG0gihFp2hmCIa0MShRoSyiM1yDLmQRLmLsL4MRnmA2UzfRnznVnNL4nR7ZnRQFnzN8L7UPL7WFMmCZU47Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLmvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9727&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-nm-WsUmQfo7-ioH7MfM7UPLzVRLl-gPUmL4nzCbM4Cinll0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybM1yYn1hkUlLaL4UZL8lYLmMVU4QfL4liL7MVnlQVnlrFLzG8L7-sLNrFMmQRU4NJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4NsLmvJqdLnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=9727&e=.jpg"}